  "dealer_description": "This 2023 Ford F-150 Raptor in striking black delivers the performance and capability you demand from a premium truck built for serious off-road adventure and daily capability.\n\n- Power Tailgate and Twin Panel Moonroof\n- Raptor 37 Performance Package with Sport Tuned Shock Absorbers\n- 37x12.5R17 All-Terrain Tires on 17\" Forged Aluminum Bead-Lock Capable Wheels\n- Raptor Carbon Fiber Package with unique Low gloss black accents\n- Pro Power Onboard 2KW\n- B&O Unleashed Sound System with 18 speakers and SiriusXM 360L\n- SYNC\u00ae 4 with Enhanced Voice Recognition and Connected Navigation\n- Leather Trim Seats with Heated Front and Rear Seating\n- Electronic Locking Differential with 4.10 Axle Ratio\n- Adaptive Suspension with Speed-Sensing Steering\n- Heated Steering Wheel and Auto-Dimming Rear-View Mirror\n- Exterior Rear Parking Camera\n- Partitioned Lockable Fold-Flat Storage\n\nThe 3.5L V6 EcoBoost\u00ae engine paired with a 10-speed automatic transmission and 4WD delivers the balance of power and efficiency expected from the Raptor line. This truck achieves 14 city and 16 highway MPG, providing respectable fuel economy for a performance-oriented platform.\n\nThe Raptor 37 Performance Package elevates this truck beyond standard capability. The unique 17-inch forged aluminum bead-lock capable wheels wrapped in 37-inch all-terrain tires, combined with sport-tuned shock absorbers, create a foundation ready for both highway driving and challenging terrain. The distinctive Raptor 37 graphics announce this truck's serious purpose.\n\nInside, the cabin reflects premium truck design with heated leather front seats, heated rear seating, and ventilated front seats for year-round comfort. The B&O Unleashed Sound System with 18 speakers ensures every drive sounds professional. Power seats with memory function, heated steering wheel, and dual-zone automatic climate control add daily convenience to every journey.\n\nTechnology integration is seamless with SYNC\u00ae 4 featuring enhanced voice recognition and a connected navigation system. Remote keyless entry, power windows, and power door mirrors provide essential controls. The auto-dimming rear-view mirror and auto high-beam headlights adapt to driving conditions automatically.\n\nSafety features include lane departure warning, electronic stability control, traction control, and a comprehensive airbag system. The electronic locking differential with 4.10 axle ratio gives you control when traction matters most.\n\nThis 2023 Raptor represents a straightforward choice for buyers seeking legitimate off-road performance wrapped in professional truck design. Contact us to schedule your test drive today.",
